; Test the semantic distinction between cyclic indirect dispatch (computed-
; goto interpreter) and a one-shot indirect branch. No BB-count threshold or
; dependence on optional source-language loop metadata is involved.
; R5900-NOT: R5900 coalescing: cyclic indirect dispatch in acyclic
